# Annotation windows for bin/call_tandem_dup.py, hg38.
#
# A call landing in one of these reports the col-4 label in its `hotspot`
# column and is eligible for confidence=high. A call outside them is demoted
# to low regardless of read support: on real AML data, seven of eight verified
# FLT3 duplications sat 19-90 kb from this window and two recurred at identical
# coordinates in unrelated patients.
#
# VERIFY against your own annotation before clinical use. FLT3 is on the minus
# strand, so exon 14 lies at higher coordinates than exon 15.
chr13	28033700	28034500	FLT3_JM_exon14_15
chr17	44210791	44210947	UBTF_exon13_TD
